#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:28
msgid ""
"You should configure email for notifications to be notified about router "
"events"
msgstr ""
"Du bør sette opp en e-postadresse for merknader slik at du får tilsendt "
"ruterhendelser"

#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:31
msgid ""
"Turris system contains notification system. Various components, including"
" healthcheck, are using it to inform administrator about possible issues."
msgstr ""
"Turris-systemet har et merknadssystem. Forskjellige komponenter "
"(inkludert helsesjekk) bruker det til å informere administrator om mulige"
" problemer."

#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:37
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In reForis navigate to Maintenance setting and configure email "
"notifications there."
msgstr ""
"I foris går du til vedlikeholdsinnstillingen og setter opp "
"e-postmerknader der."

#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:47
msgid "Email notifications seems to be configured."
msgstr "E-postmerknader har blitt satt opp."

#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:50
#, fuzzy
